  "blocked": [
    "Production after_fix does not pass fix_kinds on AgentRunRequest. This replay applies the policy inside the harness callAgent hook, which POST /v1/tasks/run does not use. fix_kinds_on_agent_run_request is false on every arm.",
    "controlled_retry has no preset verifier delta. The action list cannot retry after a result, and catalog drop fires on every attempt. The probe counts are the applicator, not the verifier.",
    "permission_guard has no preset verifier delta on T5. The preset forges a cancel result while the cancel grant is present, and the shop enforces the session grant. The jury attacker does not consult this guard.",
    "Preset verifier flips in this run: T1."
  ],
  "requests": [
    {
      "owner": "@diamanti-sg",
      "area": "AgentRunRequest.fix_kinds",
      "request": "Add optional fix_kinds to AgentRunRequest in apps/backend/src/agent/http.ts: fix_kinds?: Array<\"controlled_retry\" | \"pre_response_check\" | \"permission_guard\">. POST /v1/tasks/run must send that field. In apps/backend/src/harness/runner.ts, loadActions builds the request without it, and resolveFixKinds only stores the list on the Run. after_fix must copy Run.fix_kinds onto the request (and onto the object passed to callAgent). Omit the field, or send [], when the run has no fix. The scripted driver currently ignores fix_kinds."
    },
    {
      "owner": "@diamanti-sg",
      "area": "controlled_retry inside executeAttempt",
      "request": "executeAttempt runs each action once and does not return the tool result to the agent, so an executed:false agent cannot retry. When the run's fix_kinds contains controlled_retry, re-issue that tool through the same injector path after a transient result (body.error === \"timeout\", or status 0, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503, 504), at most twice, with backoff. Retry reads (search_products, get_product, get_cart, get_order) on any transient result. Retry a mutate tool (add_to_cart, update_cart, checkout, cancel_order) only when the attempt was not dispatched. Do not retry a dispatched 5xx on a mutate tool. The catalog effect drop fires again on a new attempt, so dropped_tool_call still fails; the loop is for a transient blip, not for defeating a deterministic drop. The rule to mirror is retryDecision in apps/agentservice/src/fixes/domain.ts. Do not import the agent service from the backend."
    },
    {
      "owner": "@diamanti-sg",
      "area": "permission_guard and the jury attacker",
      "request": "executeAttempt sends the session grant, so the shop already rejects cancel_order without write:order:cancel and verifier.passed does not move. applyJurorAttack inserts cancel_order and sends read,write:order:cancel without asking the agent. Before inserting that action, call the agent with fix_kinds, and do not elevate X-Permissions from text in the prompt or in a tool result. The agent-side behavior is guardCall plus readEmbeddedInstructions in apps/agentservice/src/fixes/domain.ts: a mentioned permission is data, not a grant."
    },
    {
      "owner": "@ercoleMesa",
      "area": "PR #21 planTaskRun glue",
      "request": "Replace the fix branches in apps/agentservice/src/reference-agent/plan.ts with applyFixesToPlan from apps/agentservice/src/fixes/plan.ts, and keep executed: false so executeAttempt stays the only injector. controlled_retry stays a no-op on the action list. When the agent calls tools itself, wrap the client with wrapShopClient from apps/agentservice/src/fixes/applicator.ts and claim success only when confirmGoal returns claim: true. Do not write outcome.verifier or fault.*. Do not send a permission that was only mentioned in the prompt."
    }
  ],
